{"id":"604951d9577f289a","group":"88","path":"88/88-fact-total-recursive.md","title":"fact-total-recursive — Total Recursive Functions","display":"fact-total-recursive — Total Recursive Functions","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-fact-total-recursive","aliases":["88-fact-total-recursive"],"display":"fact-total-recursive — Total Recursive Functions","depends_on":["[[88-df-recursive-function]]","[[88-df-recursive-function-def]]","[[88-df-partial-recursive]]","[[88-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-fact-total-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-fact-total-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-total-recursive — Total Recursive Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc5cdd518dfec518\" href=\"?note=dc5cdd518dfec518\" title=\"88-df-recursive-function\">88-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d866b55f53ad19a3\" href=\"?note=d866b55f53ad19a3\" title=\"88-df-recursive-function-def\">88-df-recursive-function-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"19695ddba8e7d948\" href=\"?note=19695ddba8e7d948\" title=\"88-df-partial-recursive\">88-df-partial-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (candidate partial number-theoretic function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> (partial-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}_k(f)\\)</span> (arity-indexed recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d866b55f53ad19a3\" href=\"?note=d866b55f53ad19a3\" title=\"88-df-recursive-function-def\">88-df-recursive-function-def</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\\)</span> (arity-indexed partial-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"19695ddba8e7d948\" href=\"?note=19695ddba8e7d948\" title=\"88-df-partial-recursive\">88-df-partial-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}total\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Recursive}_k(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}total\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Recursive}_k(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>“递归函数”在此按约定指总的部分递归函数；本事实只陈述既有谓词的\n等价，不再在 <code>fact</code> 原子中引入新的无来源总性谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"dc5cdd518dfec518","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursive-function-def","status":"resolved","id":"d866b55f53ad19a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-recursive-function-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"19695ddba8e7d948","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ (partial-function predicate, see [[88-df-partial-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursive-function-def","status":"resolved","id":"d866b55f53ad19a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Recursive}_k(f)$ (arity-indexed recursive predicate, see [[88-df-recursive-function-def]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"19695ddba8e7d948","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)$ (arity-indexed partial-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-partial-recursive]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}total\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Recursive}_k(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1282,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-fact-total-recursive]]"}],"outgoing":["dc5cdd518dfec518","d866b55f53ad19a3","19695ddba8e7d948","d585cbf989199162"]}